      "updated": 1790189642653,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> So, over here I've got a user account :\n\n    ==> we have JIM over here\n         1) Jim tries to login to the Cluster\n        2) OpenShift is going to check the \n           Identity Provider to see if \n           there's a user jim present",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> So, over here I've got a user account :\n\n    ==> we have JIM over here\n         1) Jim tries to login to the Cluster\n        2) OpenShift is going to check the \n           Identity Provider to see if \n           there's a user jim present",
      "autoResize": true,
