      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> Now if there is a user JIM present, \n    then what is going to happen is that :\n        ==> a new Identity \n        or \n            a new user account \n        is going to be defined inside of the\n        OpenShift cluster for the user JIM",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "--> Now if there is a user JIM present, \n    then what is going to happen is that :\n        ==> a new Identity \n        or \n            a new user account \n        is going to be defined inside of the\n        OpenShift cluster for the user JIM",
