      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "--> But unlike deployments :\n        ° deployments are intended for stateless application\n    \n   A stateful set provides additional features like:\n        ° stable network identities,\n        ° persistent storage, \n        ° audit deployment \n    and \n        ° stateful scaling as well",
